# MyStake core

Personal US+IN investment **coaching copilot**. Not a broker. Not auto-trading.

## Canonical docs

- `docs/architecture.md` — system design, hosting, caching, agent overview
- `docs/product.md` — scope, access, inputs, need/later/never
- `AGENTS.md` — short index and non-negotiables

Do not re-derive architecture by searching the whole repo when these docs answer the question. If implementation must diverge, update the docs in the same change or ask first.

## Stack locks

- Frontend: Next.js on Vercel (PR previews OK)
- Auth/DB: Supabase Auth (**Google OAuth**) + Postgres + RLS
- Access: email **allowlist** + **invite codes** (owner-controlled)
- API/agents: FastAPI + **self-hosted LangGraph** on always-on host (VPS preferred; not Render free)
- Models: OpenAI primary → OpenRouter fallback
- Observability: **LangSmith tracing/evals only** — do not assume LangGraph Platform hosting
- Markets: US + India; **USD and INR separate**
- Ingestion v1: CSV + manual holdings only

## Do not

- Clerk, Auth0, or similar paid auth as default
- Serverless-only hosting for the coach graph
- Dedicated vector DB in v1 (pgvector later if needed)
- Plaid / PDF-RAG / auto-trade in v1
- Ungated public signup without whitelist/invite

## UI note

`docs/ux.md` is deferred. Keep UI simple and functional until UX docs exist; do not invent a large design system unprompted.
